904
00:56:02,625 --> 00:56:06,254
She's nice, a small-town kid, like me.

905
00:56:07,097 --> 00:56:10,032
Deedsy, you sick-ass mo' fo'....

906
00:56:10,100 --> 00:56:13,592
You got to tap that
before she starts boning other guys, kid.

907
00:56:14,204 --> 00:56:15,228
Boo-Yah!

908
00:56:17,307 --> 00:56:20,674
He thinks it's you! He thinks it's you!

909
00:56:22,312 --> 00:56:26,408
-Let's go, Cedar. Put some steam on it, kid.
-Here it comes.

910
00:56:28,952 --> 00:56:31,716
He's trying to kill me. You're good at this.

