Really?

916
00:56:45,969 --> 00:56:47,800
I didn't know he kept a diary.

917
00:56:52,175 --> 00:56:53,608
Sorry about that, dude.

918
00:56:54,010 --> 00:56:56,069
It's okay. He's a new member.

919
00:56:56,880 --> 00:56:57,972
Ball boy.

920
00:56:59,082 --> 00:57:00,049
Ball boy!

921
00:57:02,452 --> 00:57:04,443
All right, baby, I'm ready for you.

922
00:57:09,092 --> 00:57:10,252
You okay?

923
00:57:10,493 --> 00:57:13,291
