-Anderson, you liked that, didn't you?

924
00:57:13,363 --> 00:57:14,523
I did.

925
00:57:14,731 --> 00:57:17,131
Listen, Deeds, I got some good news.

926
00:57:17,200 --> 00:57:19,395
